#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kmplot; Reference"
msgstr "&kmplot; Referenca"

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Function Syntax"
msgstr "Sintaksa funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Some syntax rules must be complied with:"
msgstr "Neka sintaksna pravila moraju biti u skladu sa:"

#. Tag: screen
#: reference.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>name(var1[, var2])=term [;extensions]</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>name(var1[, var2])=term [;extensions]</userinput>"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "name"
msgstr "ime"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The function name. If the first character is <quote>r</quote> the parser "
"assumes that you are using polar coordinates. If the first character is "
"<quote>x</quote> (for instance <quote>xfunc</quote>) the parser expects a "
"second function with a leading <quote>y</quote> (here <quote>yfunc</quote>) "
"to define the function in parametric form."
msgstr ""
"Naziv funkcije. Ako je prvi znak <quote>r</quote>  parser pretpostavlja da "
"cete koristiti polarne koordinate. Ako je prvi znak <quote>r</quote> (npr. "
"<quote>xfunc</quote>) parser ocekuje drugu funkciju sa pocetnim <quote>y</"
"quote> (u ovom slucaju <quote>yfunc</quote>) kako bi definisao funkciju u "
"parametarskom obliku."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "var1"
msgstr "var1"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "The function's variable"
msgstr "Funkcijska varijabla"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "var2"
msgstr "var2"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The function <quote>group parameter</quote>. It must be separated from the "
"function's variable by a comma. You can use the group parameter to, for "
"example, plot a number of graphs from one function. The parameter values can "
"be selected manually or you can choose to have a slider bar that controls "
"one parameter. By changing the value of the slider the value parameter will "
"be changed. The slider can be set to an integer between 0 and 100."
msgstr ""
"Funkcijski <quote>grupni parametar</quote>. On mora biti razdvojen od "
"funkcijske varijable zarezom. Možete koristiti grupni parametar npr., da "
"nacrtate određeni broj grafova jedne funkcije. Vrijednost parametara se mogu "
"odabrati ručno ili možete izabrati opciju da pomocu slider bara kontrolisete "
"jedan parametar. Mijenjajuci vrijednost slidera, promjeniće se i vrijednost "
"parametra. Slider može biti podešen na cijeli broj između 0 i 100."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "term"
msgstr "termin"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "The expression defining the function."
msgstr "Izraz koji definiše funkciju."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Predefined Function Names and Constants"
msgstr "Unaprijed definisana imena i konstante funkcija"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the predefined functions and constants that &kmplot; knows can be shown "
"by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Predefined Math "
"Functions</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, which displays this page of "
"&kmplot;'s handbook."
msgstr ""
"Sve unaprijed definisane funkcije i konstante koje &kmplot; poznaje mogu "
"biti prikazane birajući <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Predefined Math Functions</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, "
"sto će prikazati ovu stranicu &kmplot; priručnika."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These functions and constants and even all user defined functions can be "
"used to determine the axes settings as well. See <xref linkend=\"axes-config"
"\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ove funkcije i konstante, pa čak i sve funkcije definisane od strane "
"korisnika, se mogu koristiti za određivanje postavke osi. Pogledajte <xref "
"linkend=\"axes-config\"/>."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Trigonometric Functions"
msgstr "Trigonometrijske funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, the trigonometric functions work in radians. However, this can "
"be changed via <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&kmplot;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Trigonometrijske funkcije su zadane da rade u radijanima. Ovo se može "
"promjeniti pomoću <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kmplot;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

