msgstr "Ostale funkcije"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "sqr(x)"
msgstr "sqr(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "The square x^2 of x."
msgstr "Kvadrat x^2 broja x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "sqrt(x)"
msgstr "sqrt(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "The square root of x."
msgstr "Korijen broja x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "sign(x)"
msgstr "sign(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The sign of x. Returns 1 if x is positive, 0 if x is zero, or &minus;1 if x "
"is negative."
msgstr ""
"Predznak broja x. Vraća 1 ukoliko je x pozitivno, 0 ukoliko je x jednako 0, "
"ili &minus;1 ukoliko je x negativno."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "H(x)"
msgstr "H(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Heaviside Step Function. Returns 1 if x is positive, 0.5 if x is zero, "
"or 0 if x is negative."
msgstr ""
"Heaviside-ova stepena funkcija. Vraća 1 ukoliko je x pozitivno, 0.5 ukoliko "
"je x jednako 0, ili 0 ukoliko je x negativno."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "exp(x)"
msgstr "exp(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "The exponent e^x of x."
msgstr "Eksponent e^x broja x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "ln(x)"
msgstr "ln(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "The natural logarithm (inverse exponent) of x."
msgstr "Prirodni logaritam (inverzna funkcija eksponenta) broja x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "log(x)"
msgstr "log(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "The logarithm of x to base 10."
msgstr "Logaritam broja x po bazi 10."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "abs(x)"
msgstr "abs(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "The absolute value of x."
msgstr "Absolutna vrijednost broja x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "floor(x)"
msgstr "floor(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rounds x to closest integer less than or equal to x."
msgstr "Zaokružuje x na najbliži cijeli broj koji je manji ili jednak broju x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "ceil(x)"
msgstr "ceil(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rounds x to the closest integer greater than or equal to x."
msgstr "Zaokružuje x na najbliži cijeli broj koji je veći ili jednak broju x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "round(x)"
msgstr "round(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rounds x to the closest integer."
msgstr "Zaokružuje x na najbliži cijeli broj."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "gamma(x)"
msgstr "gamma(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "The gamma function."
msgstr "Gama funkcija."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "factorial(x)"
msgstr "factorial(x)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "The factorial of x."
msgstr "Faktorijel broja x."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"min(x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</"
"subscript>)"
msgstr ""
"min(x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</"
"subscript>)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns the minimum of the set of numbers {x<subscript>1</subscript>,"
"x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</subscript>}."
msgstr ""
"Vraća minimum skupa brojeva {x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</"
"subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</subscript>}."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"max(x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</"
"subscript>)"
msgstr ""
"max(x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</"
"subscript>)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum of the set of numbers {x<subscript>1</subscript>,"
"x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</subscript>}."
msgstr ""
"Vraća maksimum skupa brojeva {x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</"
"subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</subscript>}."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"mod(x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</"
"subscript>)"
msgstr ""
"mod(x<subscript>1</subscript>,x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</"
"subscript>)"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns the modulus (Euclidean length) of the set of numbers {x<subscript>1</"
"subscript>,x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</subscript>}."
msgstr ""
"Vraća modul(Euklidsku dužinu) skupa brojeva {x<subscript>1</subscript>,"
"x<subscript>2</subscript>,...,x<subscript>n</subscript>}."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Predefined Constants"
msgstr "Unaprijed definisane konstante"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>pi</term>"
msgstr "<term>pi</term>"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "&pgr;"
msgstr "&pgr;"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constants representing &pgr; (3.14159...)."
msgstr "Vrijednost konstante &pgr; (3.14159...)."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>e</term>"
msgstr "<term>e</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constant representing Euler's Number e (2.71828...)."
msgstr "Konstanta koja predstavlja Euler-ov broj e (2.71828...)."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "Ekstenzije"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An extension for a function is specified by entering a semicolon, followed "
"by the extension, after the function definition. The extension can be "
"entered by using the &DBus; method parser addFunction. None of the "
"extensions are available for parametric functions but N and D[a,b] work for "
"polar functions too. For example: <screen>\n"
"                        <userinput>\n"
"                                f(x)=x^2; A1\n"
"                        </userinput>\n"
"                </screen> will show the graph y=x<superscript>2</"
"superscript> with its first derivative. Supported extensions are described "
"below:"
msgstr ""
"Ekstenzija za funkciju se obilježava tako što se unese ; a zatim ekstenzija, "
"iza definicije funkcije. Ekstenzija može biti unesena koristeći &DBus; "
"metodu parsera addFunction. Nijedna ekstenzija nije moguća za parametarske "
"funkcije ali N and D[a,b] su moguće za rad i sa polarnim funkcijama također. "
"Npr. :<screen>\n"
"                        <userinput>\n"
"                                f(x)=x^2; A1\n"
"                        </userinput>\n"
"                </screen> će prikazati graf funkcije y=x<superscript>2</"
"superscript> sa njenim prvim izvodom. Podržane ekstenzije su opisane ispod:"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>N</term>"
msgstr "<term>N</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The function will be stored but not be drawn. It can be used like any other "
"user-defined or predefined function."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija će biti spašena ali ne i nacrtana. Može se koristiti kao bilo koja "
"druga funkcija definisana od strane korisnika ili unaprijed definisana."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>A1</term>"
msgstr "<term>A1</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The graph of the derivative of the function will be drawn additionally with "
"the same color but less line width."
msgstr ""
"Graf izvoda funkcije će biti nacrtan naknadno istom bojom ali užom linijom."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>A2</term>"
msgstr "<term>A2</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The graph of the second derivative of the function will be drawn "
"additionally with the same color but less line width."
msgstr ""
"Graf drugog izvoda funkcije će biti nacrtan naknadno istom bojom ali užom "
"linijom."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "D[a,b]"
msgstr "D[a,b]"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the domain for which the function will be displayed."
msgstr "Postavlja domen na kojem će funkcija biti prikazana."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "P[a{,b...}]"
msgstr "P[a{,b...}]"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Give a set of values of a group parameter for which the function should be "
"displayed. For example: <userinput>f(x,k)=k*x;P[1,2,3]</userinput> will plot "
"the functions f(x)=x, f(x)=2*x and f(x)=3*x. You can also use functions as "
"the arguments to the P option."
msgstr ""
"Zadaje se skup vrijednosti grupnog parametra za koje će funkcija biti "
"prikazana. Npr. :<userinput>f(x,k)=k*x;P[1,2,3]</userinput> will plot the "
"functions f(x)=x, f(x)=2*x and f(x)=3*x. Također možete koristiti funkciju "
"kao argument P opcije."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that you can do all of these operations by editing the items in "
"the <guilabel>Derivates</guilabel> tab, the <guilabel>Custom plot range</"
"guilabel> section and the <guilabel>Parameters</guilabel> section in the "
"<guilabel>Functions</guilabel> sidebar too."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da sve ove operacije možete uraditi uređivanjem stavki u  "
"<guilabel>Izvodi</guilabel> sekciji,  <guilabel>Vlastiti opseg</guilabel> "
"sekciji i <guilabel>Parameters</guilabel> sekciji u <guilabel>Funkcije</"
"guilabel> sidebare-u  također."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mathematical Syntax"
msgstr "Matematička sintaksa"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmplot; uses a common way of expressing mathematical functions, so you "
"should have no trouble working it out. The operators &kmplot; understands "
"are, in order of decreasing precedence:"
msgstr ""
"&kmplot; koristi uobičajen način prikazivanja matematičkih funkcija, tako da "
"ne bi trebali imati problema da uradite sve što želite. Operatori koje "
"&kmplot; prepoznaje su, u redu po opadajućem prvenstvu izvršavanja:"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>^</term>"
msgstr "<term>^</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The caret symbol performs exponentiation. &eg;, <userinput>2^4</userinput> "
"returns 16."
msgstr ""
"Znak za umetanje koji vrši stepenovanje. &eg;, <userinput>2^4</userinput> "
"vraća kao rezultat 16."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>*</term>"
msgstr "<term>*</term>"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>/</term>"
msgstr "<term>/</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The asterisk and slash symbols perform multiplication and division . &eg;, "
"<userinput>3*4/2</userinput> returns 6."
msgstr ""
"Zvjezdica i kosa crta vrše množenje i dijeljenje. &eg;, <userinput>3*4/2</"
"userinput> vraća kao rezultat 6."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>+</term>"
msgstr "<term>+</term>"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "&minus;"
msgstr "&minus;"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The plus and minus symbols perform addition and subtraction. &eg;, "
"<userinput>1+3&minus;2</userinput> returns 2."
msgstr ""
"Simboli plus i minus vrše sabiranje i oduzimanje.  &eg;, "
"<userinput>1+3&minus;2</userinput> vraća kao rezultat 2."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "&lt;"
msgstr "&lt;"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "&gt;"
msgstr "&gt;"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "&le;"
msgstr "&le;"

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ge;"
msgstr "&ge;"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Comparison operators. They return 1 if the expression is true, otherwise "
"they return 0. &eg;, <userinput>1 &le; 2</userinput> returns 1."
msgstr ""
"Operatori poređenja. Vraćaju kao rezultat 1 ukoliko je izraz tačan, a u "
"suprotnom 0. &eg;, <userinput>1 &le; 2</userinput> vraća kao rezultat 1."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid "&radic;"
msgstr "&radic;"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The square root of a number. &eg;, <userinput>&radic;4</userinput> returns 2."
msgstr ""
"Korijen broja. &eg;, <userinput>&radic;4</userinput> vraća kao rezultat 2."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>|x|</term>"
msgstr "<term>|x|</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The absolute value of x. &eg;, <userinput>|&minus;4|</userinput> returns 4."
msgstr ""
"Apsolutna vrijednost broja x. &eg;, <userinput>|&minus;4|</userinput> vraća "
"kao rezultat 4."

#. Tag: term
#: reference.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "&plusmn;"
msgstr "&plusmn;"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each plus-minus sign gives two sets of plots: one in which the plus is "
"taken, and one in which the minus is taken.&eg;. <userinput>y = &plusmn;sqrt"
"(1&minus;x^2)</userinput> will draw a circle. These, therefore, cannot be "
"used in constants."
msgstr ""
"Svaki dvoznak plus-minus daje dva skupa crteža: jedan u kojem se uzima plus, "
"jedan u kojem se uzima minus. &eg;. <userinput>y = &plusmn;sqrt(1&minus;x^2)"
"</userinput> će nacrtati krug. Ovo se ne smije koristiti sa konstantama."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note the precedence, which means that if parentheses are not used, "
"exponentiation is performed before multiplication/division, which is "
"performed before addition/subtraction. So <userinput>1+2*4^2</userinput> "
"returns 33, and not, say 144. To override this, use parentheses. To use the "
"above example, <userinput>((1+2)*4)^2</userinput> <emphasis>will</emphasis> "
"return 144."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu prvenstvo izvršavanja što znači da ukoliko izostavimo zagrade, "
"stepenovanje će se izvršavati prije množenja/dijeljenja, koje će se "
"izvršavati prije sabiranja/oduzimanja. Zbog toga će izraz "
"<userinput>1+2*4^2</userinput>  kao rezultat vratiti 33, a ne npr. 144. Da "
"bi zaobišli ovaj problem koristite zagrade. Koristeći prijašnji primjer, "
"<userinput>((1+2)*4)^2</userinput> će vratiti kao rezultat 144."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plotting Area"
msgstr "Područje za crtanje"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, explicitly given functions are plotted for the whole of the "
"visible part of the horizontal axis. You can specify an other range in the "
"edit-dialog for the function. If the plotting area contains the resulting "
"point it is connected to the last drawn point by a line."
msgstr ""
"Unaprijed je definisano da se eksplicitno zadane funkcije crtaju na cijelom "
"vidljivom dijelu horizontalne ose. Vi možete odrediti drugi opseg u edit-"
"dialog za funkciju. Ukoliko područje za crtanje sadrži rezultujuću tačku, "
"onda će biti povezano sa posljednjom nacrtanom tačkom pomoću linije."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Parametric and polar functions have a default plotting range of 0 to 2&pgr;. "
"This plotting range can also be changed in the <guilabel>Functions</"
"guilabel> sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Parametarske i polarne funkcije imaju standardni opseg područja za crtanje "
"od 0 do 2 &pgr;. Ovaj opseg se također može promjeniti u "
"<guilabel>Functions</guilabel> sidebar-u."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crosshair Cursor"
msgstr "Krstasti kursor"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While the mouse cursor is over the plotting area the cursor changes to a "
"crosshair. The current coordinates can be seen at the intersections with the "
"coordinate axes and also in the status bar at the bottom of the main window."
msgstr ""
"Kada se kursor miša nađe iznad područja za crtanje, onda se mijenja u "
"crosshair kursor. Trenutne koordinate se mogu vidjeti na presjeku "
"koordinatnih osa ali i u statusnom bar-u na dnu glavnog prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can trace a function's values more precisely by clicking onto or next to "
"a graph. The selected function is shown in the status bar in the right "
"column. The crosshair then will be caught and be colored in the same color "
"as the graph. If the graph has the same color as the background color, the "
"crosshair will have the inverted color of the background. When moving the "
"mouse or pressing the keys Left or Right the crosshair will follow the "
"function and you see the current horizontal and vertical value. If the "
"crosshair is close to vertical axis, the root-value is shown in the "
"statusbar. You can switch function with the Up and Down keys. A second click "
"anywhere in the window or pressing any non-navigating key will leave this "
"trace mode."
msgstr ""
"Možete pratiti vrijednost funkcije preciznije ukoliko kliknete na ili pored "
"grafa. Odabrana funkcija je prikazana u statusnom bar-u u desnoj koloni. "
"Krstasti kursor će onda biti uhvaćen i biće iste boje kao i sam graf. "
"Ukoliko je graf iste boje kao i pozadina, onda će krstasti kursor biti u "
"suprotnoj boji u odnosu na pozadinu. Prilikom pomjeranja miša ili pritiskom "
"tastera Lijevo ili Desno, krstasti kursor će pratiti funkciju a vi ćete moći "
"vidjeti trenutnu horizontalnu i vertikalnu vrijednost. Ukoliko je krstasti "
"kursor blizu vertikalne ose, originalna vrijednost će biti prikazana u "
"status bar-u. Funkciju možete promijeniti pritiskom tastera Gore ili Dole. "
"Drugi klik bilo gdje u prozoru ili pritisak bilo kojeg nenavigacionog "
"tastera će prouzrokovati izlaz iz pratećeg moda."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more advanced tracing, open up the configuration dialog, and select "
"<guilabel>Draw tangent and normal when tracing</guilabel> from the "
"<guilabel>General Settings</guilabel> page. This option will draw the "
"tangent, normal and oscillating circle of the plot currently being traced."
msgstr ""
"Za naprednije praćenje, otvorite konfiguracijski dijalog, i odaberite "
"<guilabel>Draw tangent and normal when tracing</guilabel> from the "
"<guilabel>General Settings</guilabel> stranu. Ova opcija će nacrtati "
"tangentnu liniju, normalni i oscilirajući krug crteža koji se trenutno prati."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid "Coordinate System Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija koordinatnog sistema"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open this dialog select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Coordinate System...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from "
"the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Da biste otvorili ovaj dijalog odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Pogled</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Koordinatni sistem...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz "
"meni bar-a."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: reference.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the Coordinate System dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Slika dijaloga koordinatnog sistema</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: reference.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the Coordinate System dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Slika dijaloga koordinatnog sistema</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axes Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija osa"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: reference.docbook:464
#, no-c-format
msgid "Horizontal axis Range"
msgstr "Interval na horizontalnoj osi"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:466
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets the range for the horizontal axis scale. Note that you can use the "
"predefined functions and constants (see <xref linkend=\"func-predefined\"/>) "
"as the extremes of the range (&eg;, set <guilabel>Min:</guilabel> to "
"<userinput>2*pi</userinput>). You can even use functions you have defined to "
"set the extremes of the axis range. For example, if you have defined a "
"function <userinput>f(x) = x^2</userinput>, you could set <guilabel>Min:</"
"guilabel> to <userinput>f(3)</userinput>, which would make the lower end of "
"the range equal to 9."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja interval za horizontalnu osu. Imajte na umu da možete koristiti "
"unaprijed definisane funkcije i konstante (pogledajte <xref linkend=\"func-"
"predefined\"/>) kao ekstreme ovog intervala (&eg;, set <guilabel>Min:</"
"guilabel> to <userinput>2*pi</userinput>).  Također možete koristiti i "
"funkcije koje ste vi definisali kao ekstreme ovog intervala. Npr., ukoliko "
"ste definisali funkciju <userinput>f(x) = x^2</userinput>, možete postaviti "
"<guilabel>Min:</guilabel> na <userinput>f(3)</userinput>, što bi donju "
"granicu intervala postavilo na 9."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: reference.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vertical axis Range"
msgstr "Interval na vertikalnoj osi"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets the range for the vertical axis. See <quote>Horizontal axis Range</"
"quote> above."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja interval za vertikalnu osu. Pogledajte <quote>Horizontal axis "
"Range</quote> iznad."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: reference.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid "Horizontal axis Grid Spacing"
msgstr "Razmak horizontalne ose u odnosu na okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:488
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This controls the spacing between grid lines in the horizontal direction. If "
"<guilabel>Automatic</guilabel> is selected, then &kmplot; will try to find a "
"grid line spacing of about two centimeters that is also numerically nice. If "
"<guilabel>Custom</guilabel> is selected, then you can enter the horizontal "
"grid spacing. This value will be used regardless of the zoom. For example, "
"if a value of 0.5 is entered, and the x range is 0 to 8, then 16 grid lines "
"will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Ovo kontroliše razmak između linija u horizontalnom smjeru. Ako je "
"<guilabel>Automatski</guilabel> odabrano, onda će &kmplot; pokušati naći "
"razmak oko dva centimetra koji je i numerički dobar. Ako je "
"<guilabel>Prilagođeno</guilabel> odabrano, onda vi možete sami unijeti "
"razmak koji želite. Ova vrijednost će se koristiti neovisno od uvećanja. "
"Npr., ukoliko je vrijednost koju ste unijeli 0.5, a interval od x je između "
"0 i 8, tada će 16 linija biti prikazano."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: reference.docbook:496
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vertical axis Grid Spacing"
msgstr "Razmak vertikalne ose u odnosu na okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This controls the spacing between grid lines in the vertical direction. See "
"<quote>Horizontal axis Grid Spacing</quote> above."
msgstr ""
"Ovo kontroliše razmak između linija u vertikalnom smjeru. Pogledajte "
"<quote>Horizontal axis Grid Spacing</quote> iznad."

#. Tag: title
#: reference.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constants Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija konstanti"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open this dialog select <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Constants...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""
"Da biste otvorili ovaj dijalog odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmijeni</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>konstante...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz meni bar-a."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: reference.docbook:515
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the Constants dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Slika dijaloga konstanti</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: reference.docbook:521
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the Constants dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Slika dijaloga konstanti</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:526
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Constants can be used as part of an expression anywhere inside of &kmplot;. "
"Each constant must have a name and a value. Some names are invalid, however, "
"such as existing function names or existing constants."
msgstr ""
"Konstante se mogu koristiti kao dio izraza bilo gdje u &kmplot;. Svaka "
"konstanta mora imati određeno ime i vrijednost. Neka imena se ne mogu "
"koristiti, kao što su imena vec postojećih funkcija i konstanti."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two options that control the scope of a constant:"
msgstr "Postoje dvije opcije koje kontrolišu opseg konstante."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: reference.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document"
msgstr "Dokument"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select the <guilabel>Document</guilabel> checkbox, then the Constant "
"will be saved along with the current diagram when you save it to file. "
"However, unless you have also selected the <guilabel>Global</guilabel> "
"option, the constant will not be available between instances of &kmplot;."
msgstr ""
"Ako obilježite  <guilabel>Dokument</guilabel> kućicu, onda će konstanta biti "
"sačuvana zajedno sa trenutnim dijagramom kada je sačuvate u datoteku. "
"Ukoliko ne obilježite i opciju <guilabel>Global</guilabel>, onda konstanta "
"neće biti dostupna ostalim instancama &kmplot;."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: reference.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid "Global"
msgstr "Global"

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select the <guilabel>Global</guilabel> checkbox, then the Constant's "
"name and value will be written to &kde; settings (where it can also be used "
"by &kcalc;). The constant will not be lost when &kmplot; is closed, and will "
"be available again for use when &kmplot; is started again."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko obilježite <guilabel>Global</guilabel> checkbox, onda će ime i "
"vrijednost konstante biti zapisani u &kde; postavke (odakle se također može "
"koristiti pooću &kcalc;). Konstanta neće biti izgubljena kada se &kmplot; "
"zatvori i moći će se koristiti ponovo kada sljedeći put pkrenemo &kmplot;."
